# Windows 开发、Linux 部署：仓库内统一存 LF，避免 CRLF 污染 Dockerfile/compose
* text=auto eol=lf

*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# 图片是二进制，禁止行尾转换
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
